  {
   "type": "pub-curated-gallery",
   "title": "我晚上经常难以准时休息",
   "texts": [
    "/ideas/home-furnishings/zou3-jin4-wo4-shi4-ping2-jing4-xin1-xu4-pubab58f110",
    "NO",
    "ikea://cms/page-compatible-web?url=%2Fideas%2Fhome-furnishings%2Fzou3-jin4-wo4-shi4-ping2-jing4-xin1-xu4-pubab58f110&key=cn--zh--ab58f110c51511eb929fff34060b2457",
    "{\"objectId_var\":\"/ideas/home-furnishings/zou3-jin4-wo4-shi4-ping2-jing4-xin1-xu4-pubab58f110\",\"objectType_var\":\"cms/page-compatible-web\"}",
    "“也许是因为我在家办公——也许这是我的职业使然。但自从安装了智能遮光百叶帘后，我的睡眠变好了。它们不仅能阻挡外面的光线，早上还能自动打开，所以我不用设置闹钟。这就是科技的魔力！”",
    "我晚上经常难以准时休息"
   ],
